  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n[Cmmaj7]\n[G]\n[Cmmaj7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]I am a ro-\n[Cmmaj7]bot,\n[G]naked and a-\n[Cmmaj7]lone\n[G]Sent from the fu-\n[Cmmaj7]ture to build a new\n[G]home\n[Cmmaj7]\n[G]Mission accomplished,\n[Cmmaj7]find The D\n[G]Save them from\n[Cmmaj7]Daddy Ding Dong\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]And build a\n[Asus4/F#]home make it\n[F]right make it\n[E7]nice\n[Am]Kill all the evil\n[Am/G]and the Nazis\n[D9/F#]KKK, kill them all,\n[B7]dat what me must do\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]I am a ro-\n[Cmmaj7]bot, I am here a-\n[G]lone Just like a dog-\n[Cmmaj7]gy, searching for his\n[G]bone Everyone sees\n[D]me but no one under-\n[Em]stands The feeling inside\n[G7]when I have an empty\n[C]hand No one will put\n[Cmmaj7]me in their\n[G]band\n[D]Cus\n\n[Bridge]\n[G]everyone hates a ro-\n[D]bot\n[Em]But I am such a good\n[D]robot\n[C]I am not an evil\n[Cmmaj7]robot understand\n[G]\n[D]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]I am just a simple\n[D]robot hold my hand\n[C]And one of these days,\n[Cmmaj7]I’ll be a\n\n[Outro]\n[G]man\n[Cmmaj7]\n[G]\n[Cmmaj7]\n[G]",
